      "message": "\u003e Does the config file have a minimum CMake version? The option to add REQUIRED here seems to not be available from 3.7 mentioned in the CMakeLists.txt https://cmake.org/cmake/help/v3.7/module/CMakeFindDependencyMacro.html\n\u003e \n\u003e Earliest mentions of forwarding is in 3.9 https://cmake.org/cmake/help/v3.9/module/CMakeFindDependencyMacro.html\n\nThanks for double checking this. I only saw that the macro was added in 3.0 and didn\u0027t look much closer. If nothing else we could add a CMAKE_VERSION check. Let me go through the docs.\n\nUsing cmake-3.7.2 works with a toy example, though.",
